The main purpose of this project is to practice:

HTML structure
CSS Grid layout
Flexbox alignment
Responsive webpage design

Features
Grid layout using display: grid
Responsive columns using repeat()
Centered content using Flexbox
Simple and clean UI design
Multiple content boxes

Important CSS Concepts Used
display: grid
grid-template-columns
gap
display: flex
justify-content
align-items

Learning forms
Learning fieldset

# Microsoft Clone Website

A responsive front-end clone of the Microsoft homepage built using HTML5 and CSS3. This project recreates key sections of the Microsoft website, including a navigation bar, hero section, product cards, social media section, and footer.

Author
Gautam Manni
